  "description": "Security tools for Dynamicweb 10 by JustDynamics. Includes the Security Viewer: pick any security account (role, group, or user) and see its effective content access across pages, grid rows, and paragraphs — with origin explanations and misconfiguration warnings (ineffective group grants, gated sign-in pages, ignored legacy permission columns, orphaned grants). Adds a \"Tools\" section to the Content area. Requires Dynamicweb 10.8 or newer. Issues and feature requests: https://github.com/justdynamics/Truvio.Commerce.PowerApps.SecOps/issues",
